<title>JAPAN: Maruichi Steel Tube -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Maruichi Steel Tube -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 46.64		vs	   45.42</p>
<p> Operating	    5.21		vs	    4.33</p>
<p> Current		6.34		vs	    5.78</p>
<p> Net		    3.57		vs	    3.32</p>
